# Implementation-first workflow

Docs are universal: `AGENTS.md` + `docs/APPLICATION.md` (any agent/IDE).  
Before grepping the repo, read `AGENTS.md` and pick the **Task → Edit Here** row.

## Rules

- Edit the **shared** source (path constants, `SecurityConfig`, `AppBaseService`, Flyway), not every consumer.
- Prefer opening 1–3 listed files only.
- Broad search only if the map has no matching row.
- After adding a shared pattern **or changing functionality**, update `AGENTS.md`, `docs/implementation/`, and **`docs/APPLICATION.md`** (bump Last reviewed).

## Hot paths (under `src/main/java/app/school/administration/`)

| Topic | File |
|---|---|
| App overview (living) | `docs/APPLICATION.md` |
| Sign in / sign up | `auth/api/controller/AuthController.java`, `auth/application/serviceimpl/AuthServiceImpl.java` |
| Public endpoints | `auth/application/constant/AuthConstant.java` |
| Security filter chain | `common/config/security/SecurityConfig.java` |
